Z||000000||coolcat||07-03-2001||07:51 PM||||I haven't been here a long time at all but I can say with certinty that this forum is one of the binding forces in the Fiero comunity....I understand your need for time off.Running a forum by your self must be hell,and then to top it off you get some *******  to question your motives,that pisses me off and I'm relitively new here,I can only imagine how you feel. The only words I can offer are the ones I tell my self every day...In a couple of months I will be going in to the Marines. I will be out there risking my life for my country men and our way of life. With all the crap going on in the country today I some time question my motives for wanting to serve my country,and to help keep free all the scum in the country .Then I tell my self that most people arnt like that,that its only the shitty ones that get noticed in this day in age.And most people would come together and help you if you needed it rather than step on you.I guess that what I'm tring to say is that there will always be people like Ed,BUT for every one of him there are a thousand who appriciate the oppertunity that your forum provedes. I for one say thanks and if theres any thing that I can do to help you please ask.Thanks CLIFF for what you have provided us.<P>Donovan<P> <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headbang.gif"> Gettin good players is easy,gettin them to play together is the hard part||||reg||1
